e":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-11-11T21:40:37Z","updated_at":"2015-11-11T21:41:05Z","body":"Only the first issue is related to `to-single-quotes`. Code for the second one is in [eslint](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/blob/master/lib/rules/quotes.js#L44)\n\nIt is possible to use a simple solution https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/4381#issuecomment-155654293 to convert between three quote types, but with that approach code doesn't naturally split into three different modules.\n\nSince this approach is a complete rewrite of to-single-quotes module, needed to fix a problem in eslint, i propose to discuss and test it in eslint, and then we can move it to separate module if desired.\n\nOne question: should this unescape all unnecessarily escaped characters or only the original quote?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/155918351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nightwing","id":341801,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTgwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/341801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing","html_url":"https://github.com/nightwing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nightwing/received_events","type":"Us